The layout of the region file (regions.yml), the flag names, the command syntax, the permission nodes
and the messages follow WorldGuard. WorldGuard's own source is LGPL-3.0-or-later; it uses WorldEdit
(https://github.com/EngineHub/WorldEdit, GPL-3.0) for its selections, boxes and commands. Nothing of
WorldEdit's source is included here; the boxes of `/rg info`, `/rg list` and `/rg flags` are
approximations of WorldEdit's components.

Modifications for Horizon (https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon) are by Detimes and contributors.
